        "715c3a0f-671e-4a51-8eb2-1e94ef7640f4": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 320,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 200,
            "content": "## Gateway assumptions\n\n- Make API Call posts to `/hooks/appmixer-echo` without a callback URL: that hook then starts nothing and the gateway answers **204**.\n- Run Agent starts a real, short turn of agent **maya** on Haiku with no announcement, in the persistent session `hook:appmixer-e2e:openclaw-connector-check` (needs `hooks.allowRequestSessionKey` and the `hook:` prefix allowed): `maya` must be in `hooks.allowedAgentIds` and the Haiku model allowed by the gateway model policy."
        }
    }
